OL,4,CBurnham rejects devolution calls     W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GThe prime minister has rejected long-W5
OL,7,Gstanding calls from the first        W5
OL,8,Gminister of Wales for certain powers W5
OL,9,Gto be transferred from Westminster   W5
OL,10,Gto Cardiff.                          W5
OL,11,                                      W5
OL,12,GIn a letter to Rhun ap Iorwerth,     W5
OL,13,GAndy Burnham said he was "not        W5
OL,14,Gpersuaded" by the case to devolve    W5
OL,15,Gresponsibilities over policing and   W5
OL,16,Gjustice, the Crown Estate and rail   W5
OL,17,Ginfrastructure to Wales.             W5
OL,18,                                      W5
OL,19,GThe first minister said the prime    W5
OL,20,Gminister's response was "deeply      W5
OL,21,Gdisappointing".                      W5
